  "description": "Rising up in the ranks? The Race Lite Junior fits right in. The Junior shares the same 20 X 1-1/8\" wheel size as the Mini but the 6061 alloy frame, 3 piece alloy cranks and handlebars all increase in size to accommodate growing riders. Function and control are achieved through features like integrated chain adjusters, a 100% chromoly fork, CNC alloy stem and a sealed bottom bracket for smooth operation and high speeds.\n6061-T6 heat-treated alloy frame w/integrated head tube, internal cable routing, 3D dropouts w/integrated chain tensioner. 18.25\" top tube\nFull chromoly 1\" w/threadless steerer\n3-piece forged 145mm alloy cranks\n20\" alloy 28h, double-wall rims\nKenda \"Kompact\" 20 x 1 1/8\" tires",
